WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:01.540
- It's gotten to the
point where it tastes like

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:04.080
I'm just eating spoonfuls of sugar.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.890
(upbeat keyboard music)

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.510
Today we're having over a
hundred different Kit Kats.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.080
I'm gonna try 'em all
and tell you which one

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.740
is definitively the
best flavor of Kit Kat.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.470
Last time I had too much
food, I tried every item

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:17.950
on the McDonald's menu.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.170
That was very difficult.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:21.490
Oh, god.

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:24.660
Wow, oh, gosh, this is a lot of candy.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.310
Oh, wow, this guy's (bleep) pumped.

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:29.040
This one smells bonkers.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.410
Mmm, wow, it really tastes like tangerine.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.210
This one smells like dark chocolate.

00:00:34.063 --> 00:00:35.167
Tastes like chocolate.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:36.960
Alright, this is a vampire.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.650
It says, "hand talk".

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:41.260
Why is that the only English they gave me?

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.160
I don't know what flavor this is.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:45.544
Coconut? Vanilla?

00:00:45.544 --> 00:00:47.320
(light guitar music)

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.790
Remember when you're 12
and you go the dentist

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:51.360
and they give you strawberry fluoride?

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.030
It's strawberry fluoride Kit Kat.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:56.310
I'm goin' for one of these single ones.

00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:58.800
These are Kit Kat fancy.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.897
This looks like a tiny energy bar.

00:01:01.897 --> 00:01:03.520
Mmm.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.210
Tastes like eating a plant.

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:06.420
Alright, let's try strawberry.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:08.010
Oh, it smells like Pocky.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:10.550
Wow, Kit Kat is...

00:01:11.543 --> 00:01:12.609
It's Pocky.

00:01:12.609 --> 00:01:14.816
(ascending boinging)

00:01:14.816 --> 00:01:16.816
Hock-o, ho-kay-do melon.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.220
Tastes like watermelon Bubblicious.

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:20.877
Cookies and cream.

00:01:20.877 --> 00:01:22.153
Kind of tastes caramel-y.

00:01:22.153 --> 00:01:23.380
A little coffee-ee.

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:26.720
It tastes like a treat you'd
get at a Christmas open house

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:27.960
at a furniture store.

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.600
It looks to be two pieces of toasted bread

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:31.950
with beans in the middle.

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:33.480
How many have I had?

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:35.340
(speed talking)

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:36.650
16 or 17?

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:37.630
That's not very many.

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.470
This one's boring.

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:42.040
Oh, this one's called amaze-egg.

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.760
Ama-zegg, a-mez-ak-ee.

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:46.530
Oh, wow, it smells
immediately like alcohol.

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:48.560
It kinda burns like alcohol burns.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:51.060
Oh, god! (laughs)

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:52.260
Oh, it's sour!

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:54.057
Oh, whoa!

00:01:54.057 --> 00:01:56.480
Another white chocolate one, my god.

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:59.240
What, (laughs) is that?

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:00.400
Lemon?

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:02.698
Oh, god, it's white chocolate again.

00:02:02.698 --> 00:02:04.000
Grape.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.993
It's purple, as we all expected.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:10.160
Like, it's not bad.

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:11.860
Cognac and grapes.

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.360
It tastes like Jewish wine.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:16.310
So this is a nice bright green,
maybe a lime, maybe a mint?

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:19.200
Is it wasabi?

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.510
I actually kinda like this.

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:21.910
Shinshu apple?

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:24.100
Smells like green Jolly Ranchers.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:25.760
Let's try this strawberry maple.

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:27.740
Strawberry maple sounds
like what happens when

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:30.263
a cute girl from the
south marries a Canadian.

00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:34.810
No maple in that strawberry maple.

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:35.900
No strawberry.

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:37.080
Okay, you gotta up your game.

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:39.580
This is a different packaged sake one,

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:41.893
so I'm assuming it's gonna be different.

00:02:43.091 --> 00:02:45.070
That one really tastes like sake.

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:46.680
You know how, like, you're not in control,

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:48.130
like your brain is doing stuff

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:49.920
without your conscious brain knowing it?

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:52.450
I keep, like, going to
put this in my mouth,

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:55.000
and my hand keeps stopping
short of my mouth. (laughs)

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.333
(crunching)

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:00.518
This feels nice, it's cold.

00:03:00.518 --> 00:03:03.339
♪ Sa-ku-ra. ♪

00:03:03.339 --> 00:03:06.080
♪ Sa-ku-ra. ♪

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:09.913
♪ Cherry blossoms everywhere. ♪

00:03:13.813 --> 00:03:17.530
Mmm. (smacking)

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.480
That was the one.

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:20.890
This is inspired by chock-la-tor-y.

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:22.633
Sounds like a chocolate purgatory.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:29.503
Yep, tastes like butter.

00:03:32.655 --> 00:03:34.620
♪ Sa-ku-ra. ♪

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:35.717
God, it's white chocolate.

00:03:35.717 --> 00:03:37.067
♪ Sa-ku-ra. ♪

00:03:37.067 --> 00:03:38.165
Sounds like a chocolate purgatory.

00:03:38.165 --> 00:03:39.512
♪ Cherry blossoms... ♪

00:03:39.512 --> 00:03:40.345
(belches)

00:03:40.345 --> 00:03:41.860
Oh, god.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.547
I'll eat one bar.

00:03:43.547 --> 00:03:44.380
One bar.

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:51.750
I don't know if I can keep going anymore.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:52.940
Well, this is fun.

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:54.990
I didn't eat 'em all but I think I tasted

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:57.560
all the different flavors
and, in terms of an answer,

00:03:57.560 --> 00:04:01.410
this matcha, the sakura
matcha, is the best one.

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:02.820
All right, we'll see you next time

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:05.071
on Keith ruins his stomach.

00:04:05.071 --> 00:04:08.140
(ominous chord)

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:08.973
- So, as you just saw,

00:04:08.973 --> 00:04:10.590
Keith didn't actually
finish the challenge.

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:13.510
So, I thought that I'll
surprise him with more Kit Kats

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:15.711
that he has to finish
by the end of the day.

00:04:15.711 --> 00:04:18.730
(upbeat clarinet music)

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:19.563
- Well, hey.

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:23.593
Right, yup.

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:25.943
I didn't.

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:31.550
Oh, I just have to
finish what I didn't eat,

00:04:31.550 --> 00:04:32.550
so how many is that?

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:35.713
See ya later.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:38.232
Thanks.

00:04:38.232 --> 00:04:39.420
Thanks.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:42.860
Whoa, shit, look at this!

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:44.511
Oh, my god!

00:04:44.511 --> 00:04:46.844
(crunching)

00:04:49.001 --> 00:04:50.839
That one's good.

00:04:50.839 --> 00:04:53.087
(smacking)

00:04:53.087 --> 00:04:53.920
Oh...

00:04:57.348 --> 00:04:58.598
Ooh, it's pink.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.493
Really delicate and lovely.

00:05:09.732 --> 00:05:10.565
Ugh.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.820
Nice little pile.

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:19.620
Raspberry's in the wafer.

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:21.870
(groaning)

00:05:25.064 --> 00:05:27.597
I hope you enjoy the video.

00:05:27.597 --> 00:05:31.264
